.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
unraid
*.md
!scripts/**/*.md
# Shipped so sessions can copy it into a project from inside the container.
!config/templates/*.md
# ...and the changelog, which the welcome panel shows once per image update:
# it has to travel with the image it describes (the Dockerfile copies it).
!CHANGELOG.md
# ...and the docs' Markdown, which the Help page reads (R258); their
# screenshots stay out.
!docs/*.md
.DS_Store
# What a working tree holds that no image is made of: build output, the code
# map, other branches' checkouts and Python's caches. A build from a tree
# sent them all to the builder (dist alone can be gigabytes).
dist
.bb-map
.worktrees
.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
